.TH "SYD\-FS" "1" "2026\-09\-01"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
\fBsyd\-fs\fR \- Print the filesystem type of the given file or current working directory
.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
\fBsyd\-fs\fR \fI[file]\fR
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The \fBsyd\-fs\fR utility prints the filesystem type of the given file or
current working directory.\&
.PP
.SH SECURITY
.PP
\fIsyd\-fs\fR(1) does not follow (magic) symbolic links in any component of
the given path utilizing \fIopenat2\fR(2) resolve flags
\fBRESOLVE_NO_SYMLINKS\fR and \fBRESOLVE_NO_MAGICLINKS\fR.\&
.PP
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fIsyd\fR(1), \fIsyd\fR(2), \fIsyd\fR(5), \fIopenat2\fR(2), \fIstatfs\fR(2)
.PP
\fBsyd\fR homepage: https://sydbox.\&exherbo.\&org/
.PP
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
